## 🎯 Quick Checklist Before Launch

1. ✅ All critical paths (search, add‑to‑cart, checkout) tested end‑to‑end.  
2. ✅ Responsive layout passes mobile viewport tests.  
3. ✅ Lighthouse score ≥ 90 (performance, accessibility, best practices).  
4. ✅ Analytics & error tracking integrated (Google Analytics, Sentry).  
5. ✅ CI/CD pipeline set up (GitHub Actions, GitLab CI).  

